  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new update made a change that forces avatars to have their textures work like a LOD system. (Level of detail) This update enabled the Mipmap streaming. I personally don't like that a LOD system has been implemented into this amazing game. I would like for VRChat to allow players to make it so that textures/materials are optional for the LOD system.\n\nSolution:\n\nThere could be a setting within VRChat itself, where people on quest could have the LOD system work, or not. This would be amazing, since the option would be different for everyone. Anyone could choose to have the LOD system that works, or not.\n\nJust a simple warning that says, \"Disabling the LOD system could impact performance, and might kick you home\" so that players are aware of what disabling the LOF system does performance wise. (Please consider adding this)",
